achievement-cultcollegium-join-name = No Compromise
achievement-cultcollegium-join-desc = Start a round as a Collegium novice or a cultist.

achievement-collegium-initiation-name = Initiation
achievement-collegium-initiation-desc = In one round, as a collegium novice, visit the library, lecture hall, Spellward, training grounds, main hall, alchemy chamber, and collegium dungeon.

achievement-collegium-refill-barrier-name = Keeper of the Barrier
achievement-collegium-refill-barrier-desc = Replenish the barrier's energy as a member of the Collegium.

achievement-collegium-rune-stones-name = Rune Gatherer
achievement-collegium-rune-stones-desc = Gather all runestones while playing for the collegium.

achievement-collegium-spell-items-name = Full Arsenal of Charms
achievement-collegium-spell-items-desc = Obtain items created by the following casts: healing, boost, consecration, and ice dagger, while playing for the collegium.

achievement-collegium-full-armor-name = Clad in Iron
achievement-collegium-full-armor-desc = Wear an iron cuirass, plate gauntlets, and plate boots, and carry a shield and a mana amulet while playing for the collegium.

achievement-collegium-become-mage-name = Collegium Mage
achievement-collegium-become-mage-desc = Enter as a collegium mage. Noviceship lies behind you; now the arcane arts are truly yours.

achievement-collegium-cult-altars-barrier-name = Ritual and Defense
achievement-collegium-cult-altars-barrier-desc = In one round, visit every cult altar and replenish the barrier's energy seven times while playing for the collegium.

achievement-collegium-become-archmage-name = Collegium Archmage
achievement-collegium-become-archmage-desc = Enter as the collegium archmage. The summit of the magical path.

achievement-collegium-legion-letter-name = The Legion's Word
achievement-collegium-legion-letter-desc = Obtain the Legion's letter as the collegium archmage.

achievement-collegium-rebel-letter-name = Alliance with the North
achievement-collegium-rebel-letter-desc = Obtain the insurgents' letter as the collegium archmage.

achievement-collegium-both-letters-name = Double Game
achievement-collegium-both-letters-desc = In one round, obtain both the Legion's letter and the insurgents' letter as the collegium archmage.

achievement-collegium-swag-name = Anointed of Magnus
achievement-collegium-swag-desc = In one round, as the archmage: equip the archmage's robe and hood, speedwalker boots, any medallion, forstone or ebonite gloves, and carry a gilded falchion and 1000 revents.

achievement-cult-initiation-name = Ave The Truth!
achievement-cult-initiation-desc = In one round, as a cultist, visit the armory, ritual site, altar hub, and cult dungeon, and obtain the cult book.

achievement-cult-any-weapon-name = Blade of Truth
achievement-cult-any-weapon-desc = Obtain any cult weapon.

achievement-cult-armor-name = Cult Vestments
achievement-cult-armor-desc = Obtain cult armor.

achievement-cult-cursed-scroll-name = Cursed Word
achievement-cult-cursed-scroll-desc = Obtain a cursed scroll while playing for the cult.

achievement-cult-mage-round-name = Dark Spellcaster
achievement-cult-mage-round-desc = In one round, learn a healing or boost spell, wear a cult magic robe, and carry a grimoire.

achievement-cult-visit-collegium-name = In the Enemy's Den
achievement-cult-visit-collegium-desc = Infiltrate the collegium while playing for the cult.

achievement-cult-become-preacher-name = Cult Preacher
achievement-cult-become-preacher-desc = Enter as the cult preacher. From now on, you bring truth to the masses.

achievement-cult-preacher-obelisk-name = Fall of the Mages
achievement-cult-preacher-obelisk-desc = In one round, as the preacher, destroy the mages' obelisk and obtain the archmage's robe and hood.

achievement-cult-preacher-legion-letter-name = Word of the Empire
achievement-cult-preacher-legion-letter-desc = Obtain the Legion's letter as the cult preacher.

achievement-cult-preacher-rebel-letter-name = Word of Rebellion
achievement-cult-preacher-rebel-letter-desc = Obtain the insurgents' letter as the cult preacher.

achievement-cult-preacher-both-letters-name = All the World's Secrets
achievement-cult-preacher-both-letters-desc = In one round, obtain both the Legion's letter and the insurgents' letter as the cult preacher.

achievement-cult-preacher-swag-name = Lord of Truth
achievement-cult-preacher-swag-desc = In one round, as the preacher: equip the preacher's robe and hood, speedwalker boots, any medallion, any cult weapon, ebonite or forstone gloves, and carry 1000 revents.
